6
00:00:16,597 --> 00:00:19,500
From Italy to Poland.

7
00:00:19,757 --> 00:00:23,243
Under your command

8
00:00:23,263 --> 00:00:26,225
We shall rejoin the nation.

9
00:00:26,691 --> 00:00:29,986
March, march, Dąbrowski,

10
00:00:30,037 --> 00:00:33,460
from Italy to Poland.

11
